# nostr-homed ignore drop-in — belt-and-braces exclusion of the
# portable-home FUSE mountpoint. The primary defence is the xdev
# check in nh_syncd_ignore (mount is on a different st_dev, so
# capture ignores it automatically). This file makes the intent
# explicit for operators who inspect the ignore set.
#
# The mount lives at $HOME/Portable by default; users can override
# via NH_FUSE_MOUNTPOINT / ~/.config/nostr-homed/fuse.conf, in which
# case they should add the chosen path to ~/.config/nostr-homed/ignore
# too.
Portable/
